{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷のセンター街？歩いてたらずっと乃木坂の曲かかってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば原宿でも♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、カラオケ、雑貨屋さん、洋服屋さん、色々なとこでかかってて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前も友達と新宿歩いてたら\nまあやが写ってるポスター見つけて\nなんか不思議だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは『気づいたら片想い』のMV撮影の時のoffショット"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかまあやがかずみんに怒ってるようにみえる ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんとななみんはなんかめっちゃ笑ってる〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルのパンフレット撮影の時の衣装"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、プリンシパル待ってるねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてMステ ！\nミュージックステーションに出演させていただきましたっ ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたくて 感謝です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとうございましたm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステ出演も緊張するけど、おめでとう♪\nや頑張って！とか\n握手会楽しかったよ！\nとか、今度行くよ！\nチャイナ又着て！とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入学おめでとうや、乃木どこ、雑誌見たよ♪等々"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が居てくれるから まあやは前を向いて進むことが出来ます。\n沢山の経験をさせてもらえることが出来てます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも本当に心強いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃと仕事終わり渋谷に行ってきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チュロスやご飯を食べて、沢山歩きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山声かけてくださったかた、ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握は、まいまいと一緒です(//∇//)\nまいみんの皆様、宜しくお願いします\n楽しみに待ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやファミリーの皆様に\n逢える〜♪楽しみo(^o^)o楽しみo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ファミリーの皆様、気をつけて来てください。\n楽しみに待ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日はひめちゃんの誕生日で〜す(^○^)\n歌もダンスも出来て、アイドル！って感じで、同じ広島出身だから最初の頃は一緒に新幹線で東京に来てました。\n素敵な1年になりますように〜o(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月9日発売の雑誌ボム見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、あみあみ(能條愛未ちゃん)が主演の映画「死の実況中継 劇場版」\n絶対恐いと思うけど、見に行きたい！\n...でも恐い...でも行きたい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆は恐い映画とかよく見ますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/04/12/0139847/0003.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}